body:
@osseonews :
Yes this is fixed in the package !
Using a simple `<a>` tag does work but it beats the purpose of making Single Page Apps, for example you will lose the `algoliasearch` cache so any subsequent `back` button click will trigger a request to Algolia again.

@Raesta :
I will need a reproduction to help please, can be a Codesandbox or a repo.
Are you using a custom `createURL` ? This normally shouldn't ever return `null`.
